1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
Recreation & Meals

2
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:37,350
As newborn babes, long for
the guileless milk of the
word.

3
00:00:37,640 --> 00:00:40,600
Turn to the Lord within
you. You have to learn to
realize,

4
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:43,300
Oh Lord, You're inside of
me.

5
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:46,450
When these kids are saying
things to me, You're inside
of me.

6
00:00:46,510 --> 00:00:51,320
How does a child of God
respond to things?

7
00:00:51,690 --> 00:00:54,100
I was saved in sixth grade,
like many of you all.

8
00:00:54,170 --> 00:00:57,590
I did not know the way to
go on in my Christian life.

9
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:59,500
I thought I was saved, and
that's it.

10
00:00:59,550 --> 00:01:01,700
But I always searched for
something deeper.

11
00:01:01,810 --> 00:01:03,530
I wanted something more in
my life.

12
00:01:04,010 --> 00:01:06,950
I wanted a life of meaning.
I wanted a life of purpose.

13
00:01:07,590 --> 00:01:10,010
That is where the real joy
is.

14
00:01:10,710 --> 00:01:13,610
I was searching for
success. I was searching
for money.

15
00:01:13,610 --> 00:01:15,450
I was searching for a
career,

16
00:01:15,450 --> 00:01:17,050
and none of those things
satisfy,

17
00:01:17,050 --> 00:01:19,100
because we are made in
God's image.

18
00:01:19,100 --> 00:01:21,850
So we are made to contain
and to express God.

19
00:01:21,850 --> 00:01:24,410
So if we're not being
filled with God,

20
00:01:24,410 --> 00:01:26,550
we're not going to be
satisfied,

21
00:01:26,550 --> 00:01:28,250
and God is not going to be
satisfied.

22
00:01:28,790 --> 00:01:31,000
Your highlight of the
Summer School of Truth?

23
00:01:31,050 --> 00:01:34,650
Being together with the
saints.

24
00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:36,000
Alright! How about you?

25
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,500
I like the songs.

26
00:01:37,500 --> 00:01:39,500
There's just a lot of
people singing,

27
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:42,930
and you can feel the Lord's
presence. It's really nice.

28
00:01:43,130 --> 00:01:44,700
Great! Would you come back?

29
00:01:44,810 --> 00:01:45,200
Yes!

30
00:01:45,410 --> 00:01:46,400
Awesome!
